@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@token = 

# ==========================================================
# ESG CRM - API Tests
# ==========================================================
# Variables:
#   @baseUrl  - URL base del backend (localhost:7071/api)
#   @token    - JWT token (obtener del login)
#
# Respuesta estandar:
#   { "success": true, "data": {...}, "message": "...", "timestamp": "...", "statusCode": 200 }
# ==========================================================


# ==========================================================
# 1. HEALTH & AUTH
# ==========================================================

### Health Check - Verificar conexion a BD
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/health/db

### Login - Obtener JWT
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Crear Usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/user/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "newuser123",
  "name": "New User",
  "role": "user",
  "membershipPaid": false
}


# ==========================================================
# 2. CLIENTS (CRM)
# ==========================================================

### GET - Listar todos los clientes (PUBLICO)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/clients

### GET - Listar clientes con paginacion
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/clients?page=1&limit=10

### GET - Buscar clientes por nombre, email o NIT
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/clients?search=juan&page=1&limit=10

### GET - Obtener cliente por ID (requiere JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/clients/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

